C4-fix: section-7 mutation proof + negative tests for the new oracle plumbing
==============================================================================
Date: 2026-09-27. Host: Windows Git Bash, py -3. All output verbatim.

Context: scripts/build-disk.sh now substitutes a real 128-hex blake2b-512
digest of the kernel ELF into kernel/limine.conf's path line and embeds the
result; the expectation sidecar is build/limine.conf.<image name>.
verify-disk.py section 7 ("bootchain: kernel digest in the embedded config")
re-derives the digest with hashlib.blake2b and compares. These tests prove
the new plumbing fails loudly and that section 7 is not decorative.

Digest under test (eb860687...f43dd, 128 hex chars):
eb860687a4507a32dce2556cf332d174205b1e806704f64dcba43056453cc740dfe69266ca7f7c4f85d0367175a400fbeaeaa49e1c7689810e31f4f2404f43dd

